# Karaf's JAAS realm — generated at container start by
# containers/fzl-karaf-camel-integration/entrypoint.sh from FZL_KARAF_USER /
# FZL_KARAF_PASSWORD in .env. Never commit it: it guards the SSH console, JMX
# and the web console. See users.properties.template alongside it.
